```cypher
MATCH (s:Set)-[:IN_THEME]->(t:Theme)
WHERE s.year = 2014
  AND (t.name = 'Duplo' OR EXISTS {
    MATCH (t)-[:SUBTHEME_OF*1..]->(parent:Theme)
    WHERE parent.name = 'Duplo'
  })
RETURN count(DISTINCT s) AS count;
```

```cypher
